# The Antechamber: the front end's room, a quiet hall before the descent.
# A supported subset of DCSS .des (packages/vault); tile names are the
# server's own (tileinfo). The eye stands at @ in the middle facing north,
# across the hall to the down staircase in a recess of the north wall, a
# granite statue either side of its mouth. The light stands between the
# statues, so the stairs are the brightest thing in the room. To the east a
# small pool, deep water with a sacred lotus afloat on it inside a shore
# of shallows, a mangrove at one corner, bushes and fungus about the rim
# and a cobweb in the corner beside it. The west side has no wall at all:
# a wood of trees, some of them dead, stands on dark grass where it would
# be, the dark showing between the trunks, toadstools in the shade, and a
# dirt path leads away into it under a stone arch, a lantern by the arch.
# Off the path a gravestone, a lantern of shadows left beside it.
NAME: orbrun_antechamber
TILE:  # = wall_brick_dark
TILE:  c = wall_crystal_bookcase
FTILE: . = floor_grey_dirt
FTILE: w = dngn_deep_water
FTILE: L = dngn_deep_water
FTILE: T = floor_grass_dark
FTILE: p = floor_dirt
FTILE: A = floor_dirt
FTILE: s = dngn_shallow_water
FTILE: M = dngn_shallow_water
FTILE: D = floor_grass_dark
FTILE: G = floor_grass_dark
FTILE: n = floor_grass_dark
FTILE: t = floor_grass_dark
KFEAT: > = dngn_stone_stairs_down
KFEAT: 8 = dngn_granite_statue
KFEAT: _ = dngn_altar_ecumenical
KFEAT: { = dngn_fountain
KFEAT: ^ = dngn_trap_web
KFEAT: T = dngn_tree
KFEAT: D = dngn_tree_dead
KFEAT: M = dngn_mangrove
KFEAT: A = dngn_stone_arch
KFEAT: G = dngn_gravestone
KFEAT: N = dngn_fountain_novelty_lantern
KMONS: P = mons_plant
KMONS: L = mons_sacred_lotus
KMONS: B = mons_bush
KMONS: f = mons_fungus
KMONS: t = mons_toadstool
KITEM: ! = potion_offset
KITEM: ? = scroll
KITEM: $ = gold05
KITEM: n = misc_lantern_of_shadows
EYE:   @ N
LIGHT: l
